{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ba62ce0374d97047507e9e296543ae4e6e887f9e0a9ab6e41a606d55087d50b", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の一環で、静香は\n動物園でのトークショーに出演することになった）", "zh": "（作为Cosplay写真企划的一环，静香将出演在动物园举办的脱口秀）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "d6ac14950f520ab19d88b3868038663ac9ca14239945808f04e49772c36cbbfc", "ja": "そういえば……この衣装、\nちゃんとレオパードの模様になってるんですね。", "zh": "说起来……这套服装，确实是豹纹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c9740f04f97ea8de9ae8116a4f4ef9abbf0db102525ece7d51854dbccd614284", "ja": "模様……？", "zh": "花纹……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d481ad374296bca4a3e53926a752728850cd011424f08f36f39b6a3e19cfd1f", "ja": "はい。{$P$}、ヒョウって、\nチーターやジャガーに似てると思いませんか？", "zh": "是的。{$P$}先生，您不觉得豹子和猎豹、美洲豹很像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6534f700217bf386ba43ef503b0b9ea63b81a1ea3362d861d5cb48c85a75ce5a", "ja": "チーター、ジャガー……。言われてみれば！\nでもどこが違うかと言われると難しいな……？", "zh": "猎豹、美洲豹……仔细想想，确实如此！\n不过要说它们究竟有什么不同，就有点难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "fec5d0169d89acf349e71fbde7fe0127a072701b1b331d2c127a35ef7dee6c05", "ja": "そうですよね、そうですよね！　ふふふ……\nそんなことだと思って、ちゃんと調べてきたんです！", "zh": "就是这样，就是这样！呵呵呵……\n我就猜到会这样，所以特意好好查过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eb49c47bce77851f069e26716843920e0e6af89847ec6d48c101edf7489d3e6b", "ja": "おお！　さすが静香！", "zh": "哦！不愧是静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "91e35364efbd8a13d85bc2fc7c712c47e4870427da17f30161b5e0dc50a12829", "ja": "ヒョウとチーターとジャガーを見分けるポイントは……\nこの模様です！", "zh": "区分豹、猎豹和美洲豹的关键在于……\n就是这些花纹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "95318f8fc5c325c11e62d3d2cb350111f29000a5898e655c9ce8f181d96fa1cf", "ja": "チーターの模様は、シンプルな斑点。ヒョウは\nこの衣装みたいに、茶色の周りを黒い色が囲っていて。", "zh": "猎豹的花纹是简单的斑点。花豹则像这套服装一样，棕色的周围还被黑色包围着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "f8a8bfe16e01224eb99bc1a2caa799556891aadfe5ee3c4a8418f34b949ce387", "ja": "ジャガーは、さらにその模様の中に、\n小さな点が入っているんです！", "zh": "美洲豹则是在那种花纹里，还带着小小的斑点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1010_se", "source_sha256": "4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8bf32494f3162d143be598cd50119945df4ec3113255f695a864987dfb95db37", "ja": "すごいじゃないか、静香！\nもしかして、トークのために準備してきたのか？", "zh": "太厉害了，静香！\n难道你为了这次谈话，提前准备过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "9750694bf937fffe972d8155819ae98504e60ec4cd08b5702047766e7772c000", "ja": "もちろんです！　言葉だけじゃ伝わりにくいと思って\n説明で使うために絵も描いてきました！", "zh": "当然！我觉得光靠语言不太容易传达，所以还画了图，准备在说明时使用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1013_p", "source_sha256": "db411b9617e0679f02befa5bd6e111636c5feaed18a404d55b7af2f4fb668230", "ja": "……絵を？　静香が？", "zh": "……画了画？静香你画的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6ac780a293e2ae020e52af03e04151631cd2e610d1ef36c3be3abe9709c4ed8", "ja": "はい！　お客さんもわかりやすいと思うんです。\nでも、写真を用意する時間はありませんから……。", "zh": "对！我觉得这样客人也更容易理解。\n不过，我们没有时间准备照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "1caed058aecb9ba19c2e3c7a9bd8a49ef337d7b32bbb7cc91bac29948c15cb3c", "ja": "私が描いた方が早いかなって！\n……やっぱり、使わないほうがいいですか？", "zh": "我来画的话应该更快！\n……还是说，最好别用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0760d1de217809936359fbbe215df69a81fe0030bdab4f9d7cdb5d681e21f29e", "ja": "いや！　た、確かに、イラストがあった方が親切だな！\n……たぶん。", "zh": "不！确、确实，有插图的话是更贴心呢！\n……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "ce7649b801911558bc10f3fd1e8095ee17398778721a98d2ad512e03b7fb8a7c", "ja": "ですよね！　見ていてください。\nしっかりトークを盛り上げてみせますから！　ふふ♪", "zh": "就是嘛！请看着吧。\n我一定会好好活跃谈话气氛的！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0603_1018_p", "source_sha256": "af7a2865fba72509a4a25d08858f42bd591adf157c9b741bf0552ffbed1bf8d9", "ja": "（トークショーは大盛り上がりで終わった。静香の絵で\n少しざわついた気もしたが……うん、結果オーライ！）", "zh": "（谈话秀在一片热烈气氛中圆满结束了。虽然静香的画好像引起了一点骚动……不过，结果没问题就好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
